'''Restricted Area''' (ゆらぎの禁制区域 ''Yuragi no Kinsei Kuiki'', '''Forbidden Zone of Fluctuation''') is the 15th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 113th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]] and is available up to {{2c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
The difficulty here ramps up significantly compared to the previous subchapters due to one thing: the new enemy introduced here, [[Oldstrich]]. While he only appears in half of the stages, he's still quite the menace, especially in the [[Heaven-Defying Fruit|final stage]].
{{LegendDiff|120}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 1 new enemy:
*[[Oldstrich]]: A [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] variant of [[R.Ost]] with higher health, attack power, range and speed, unlimited revives and a 20% chance to do a Toxic attack that deals 20% of cats' maximum HP as damage.

